    "answer": {
      "short": "$0.8$ is larger. $8\\%=0.08$, which is less than $0.8$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}8\\% &= 8\\div100\\\\&=0.08\\end{align*}$$\nSince $0.8>0.08$, the decimal $0.8$ is larger.",
